# Scratch space for agent hand-off prompts, notes, and throwaway files.
# Lives in-repo (rather than /tmp) so it shows up in the IDE and is easy to
# inspect; never committed.
.scratch/

# Per-machine working notes for agent sessions. This repo is public, so the
# notes stay out of history; being ignored also means they do NOT sync
# between machines.
HANDOFF.md
